# Example library identifier to physical location map, for use with an
# Apache RewriteMap.  See the "Apache Rewrite Tricks" chapter of the
# Evergreen documentation, the commented example virtual host in eg.conf,
# and libid.txt.example.
#
# The value is the numeric actor.org_unit.id, not the org unit shortname.
# List your own with:
#
#     SELECT id, shortname, name FROM actor.org_unit ORDER BY id;
#
# The ids below are those created by the Concerto sample data set.  Only
# org units that a patron might browse to need an entry here.

CONS    1
SYS1    2
SYS2    3
BR1     4
BR2     5
BR3     6
BR4     7
SL1     8
BM1     9
